  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• In a large baking dish, add gnocchi (see ingredients) and enough olive oil (2 1/2 tbs for 2 people/ 1/3 cup for 4 people) to coat the gnocchi. Season.\n• Bake until crispy, 10-14 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63e1f93378f086003207a9b9/step-f776e905.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Pick and finely chop rosemary leaves. TIP: Run your fingers down the rosemary stalk to remove the leaves easily.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63e1f93378f086003207a9b9/step-804555be.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook garlic, dried oregano (see ingredients), soffritto mix, a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) and the salt, stirring, until softened, 6-7 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63e1f93378f086003207a9b9/step-9d1a5f90.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the baking dish with the gnocchi, add veggies, baby spinach leaves, diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, the butter, the brown sugar, rosemary and vegetable stock powder. Season and stir to combine.\n• Sprinkle over shredded Cheddar cheese and bake until golden, 8-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63e1f93378f086003207a9b9/step-1d9e6cc8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice pear.\n• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of the vinegar and olive oil. Season, then add pear and salad leaves. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63e1f93378f086003207a9b9/step-78db2660.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide cheesy grilled gnocchi between plates.\n• Serve with pear salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63e1f93378f086003207a9b9/step-350abae2.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
